## Controller Action 規範

每個 action 加 XML doc，說明端點用途；回傳型別明確（不用 `ActionResult<T>` 省略泛型）：

```csharp
// ✅ Correct
/// <summary>查詢會員訂單列表（依日期範圍）</summary>
[HttpGet("getOrders")]
public Task<GetOrdersResponse> GetOrders([FromQuery] GetOrdersRequest request)
    => _orderService.GetOrdersAsync(request);

// ❌ Wrong — 無 XML doc，Swagger 看不到說明
[HttpGet("getOrders")]
public Task<IActionResult> GetOrders([FromQuery] GetOrdersRequest request)
    => ...
```

